#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:2
msgid "Contributing to cc3"
msgstr "Doprinos projektu cc3"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:4
msgid ""
"We encourage people to contribute their projects, libraries, bugfixes, and "
"enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Potičemo ljude da doprinesu svoje projekte, biblioteke, ispravke pogrešaka i"
" poboljšanja."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:8
msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:10
msgid ""
"The best way to contribute bugfixes are through the ticket system. Patches "
"are welcome."
msgstr ""
"Najbolji način za doprinos ispravcima pogrešaka je putem sustava tiketa. "
"Zakrpe su dobrodošle."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:14
msgid "Wiki"
msgstr "Wiki"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:16
msgid ""
"We are investigating having personal pages on the wiki for contributed code "
"and ideas."
msgstr ""
"Istražujemo mogućnost osobnih stranica na wikiju za doprineseni kod i ideje."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:20
msgid "Discussion"
msgstr "Rasprava"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:22
msgid ""
"The discussion board is open for posting. Consider posting ideas or code!"
msgstr ""
"Diskusijski forum otvoren je za objavljivanje. Razmislite o objavljivanju "
"ideja ili koda!"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:25
msgid "SVN Access"
msgstr "SVN pristup"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/contributing.rst:27
msgid ""
"We are also investigating giving out commit access to parts of the version "
"control repository. This way, interested people can directly contribute code"
" to the project."
msgstr ""
"Također istražujemo davanje pristupa za commit dijelovima repozitorija za "
"kontrolu verzija. Na taj način, zainteresirani ljudi mogu izravno "
"doprinijeti kod projektu."
